{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7663462116427155758","title":"计划管培生-2027校招","description":"1、新产品试产与量产交付：开发阶段：制定试产计划（NPI），跟进代工厂首件确认、良率达标（≥95%启动量产）。量产阶段：输出月/周/日排产指令，协调代工厂资源（如SMT线体分配、工人排班）。；\n2、工厂物料与进销存管理：监控代工厂客供料库存（WIP、成品），实施JIT进料（按生产节拍进料）。定期盘点代工厂物料，审核超耗索赔；\n3、应急交付与逆向管理：处理紧急需求（如电商大促缺货），协调延长工时及工作日加班满足。管理退换货返修流程（如售后不良品返厂），协调代工厂重工资源； \n4、物料协同：跟进物料交付，确保原材料与零部件及时入库； \n5、执行监控：跟踪生产进度，处理异常（如设备故障、质量偏差）。 ","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历；\n2、专业领域包括供应链管理、物流、工商管理等，理工科背景优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784288983352,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7663462116427008302","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}